                                                "sense_id": "f90c40ef-8629-3bf2-b05c-82797b7d8296",
                                                "text": "The vocal pedagogue loves the Master Class idea. Such classes are usually conducted by the more plutocratic teachers for periods of from two to six weeks. Many of them vaguely promise to deliver a complete technique within that time."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
